OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council chief investigated in
OL,4,ADUP mayor clothing probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ex-council chief executive is a
OL,7,Fsubject in a police investigation into
OL,8,Fa former Democratic Unionist Party
OL,9,F(DUP) mayor's clothing expenses.
OL,11,FAnne Donaghy is one of three people
OL,12,Freferred to prosecutors for
OL,13,Fconsideration over alleged misconduct
OL,14,Fin public office at Mid and East Antrim
OL,15,FBorough Council.
OL,17,FIt is the latest case surrounding its
OL,18,Fhandling of Freedom of Information
OL,19,F(FoI) legislation after Donaghy was
OL,20,Fconvicted on Wednesday of two charges
OL,21,Fover the deletion of an email to former
OL,22,FDUP leader Arlene Foster.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
