OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council chief investigated in
OL,4,ADUP mayor clothing probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonaghy's solicitor told BBC News NI
OL,7,Fthe allegations would be "met with the
OL,8,Fsame robustness as this week's
OL,9,Fproceedings which are now under
OL,10,Fappeal".
